+ * the ARMv8 one: drivers/gpu/drm/panfrost matches "arm,mali-bifrost" (this
+ * GPU's compatible string) to default_data, which never sets
+ * GPU_QUIRK_FORCE_AARCH64_PGTABLE, so io-pgtable builds ARM_MALI_LPAE.  In
+ * that format (drivers/iommu/io-pgtable-arm.c):
